    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Warpbane Task Force",
    "summary": "The **Hallowed Ground** of your army covers:\n\n- Your deployment zone, always\n- The area within 6\" of your **PURIFIER SQUAD** units\n- **No Man's Land** for a phase if, as it starts, you hold half or more of its objective markers\n- The opposing deployment zone, checked the same way\n\nFor melee attacks by models in your **GREY KNIGHTS** units, and for their ranged attacks against visible targets, Hit rolls of 1 may be re-rolled. For a **PURIFIER SQUAD**, or a unit wholly within Hallowed Ground, the whole Hit roll may be re-rolled instead.",
